Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 16:29:39 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] bonding: add shared-state XFRM offload

Offload shared XFRM state through eligible LAG lower devices.

Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5.6
Signed-off-by: Jihong Min <hurryman2212@gmail.com>
---
